        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, gomba na atuo uaambire, ‘Nchireha viha chinyume cha yo tsi, na atu a tsi ahale mutu kahi yao amuhende mrindzi wao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye achiona maadui garedza kupiga yo tsi, andapiga gunda kuonya nyo atu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mutu achisikira ro gunda ela apuze na maadui gedze gamuolage na upanga, shauriye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kukala wasikira ro gunda ela achipuza, shauriye, mana kala waphundza angetiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ye mrindzi achiona go maadui garedza na asipige gunda, nyo atu asimanye hata mmwenga aolagbwe na nyo upanga, mutu iye andaolagbwa kpwa makosage, ela mlatsowe undadaiwa ye mrindzi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phahi we mwanadamu, nikakuika ukale mrindzi wa atu a Iziraeli, kpwa hivyo phundza neno ndirokuambira na uakanye kpwa niaba yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchimuamba mutu mui, ‘Kpwa kpweli undafwa,’ nawe usimkanye akaricha njiraze mbii, mutu mui iye andafwa kpwa makosage, ela ndakudai uwe mlatsowe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela uchikanya mutu mui ariche njiraze mbii na asiriche, andafwa kpwa makosage, ela undakala ukativya maishago.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na uwe mwanadamu, aambire atu a Iziraeli, ‘Mwimwi munaamba, “Makosa gehu na dambi zehu zi dzulu yehu, naswi zikahuondeza, hunawezadze kukala moyo?” ’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aambire, ‘Kpwa kpweli dza niishivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, sifwahirwa ni chifo cha mutu mui, ela ninahamirwa ni iye agalukaye, akaricha njiraze mbii na akale moyo. Richani njira zenu, richani! Kpwa utu wani mufwe mwi atu a Iziraeli?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na uwe mwanadamu, ambira atuo, ‘Mutu wa haki kandaokolwa ni hakiye ichikala andahenda dambi. Na mutu mui kandaolagbwa achigaluka na kuricha uyiwe. Na mutu wa haki kandaweza kuishi kpwa hakiye ichikala andahenda dambi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzagbwe nkuamba mutu wa haki kpwa kpweli andaishi, ela ichikala andakuluphira hakiye na kuhenda mai, takuna hendo nono arirohenda ndiro tambukirwa. Ela andafwa kpwa mai ndigokala akagahenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nchimuambira mutu mui, ‘Kpwa kpweli undafwa,’ ela mutu iye ariche kuhenda dambi na ahende haki na garigo sawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ichikala mutu iye andauyiza arichoikirwa mzamana, andauyiza arichoiya, achilunga shariya irehayo uzima na kuricha kuhenda uyi, kpwa kpweli mutu iye andakala moyo, kandafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takuna dambi ariyoihenda ambayo indatambukirwa chinyumeche. Iye akahenda haki na garigo sawa, mutu iye kpwa kpweli andakala moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela atuo anaamba, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu kahenda haki,’ wakati ni nyo enye ndio asiokala a haki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu wa haki achiricha kuhenda haki na kuhenda mai, mutu iye andafwa kpwa gago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mutu mui achiricha maige na kuhenda haki na garigo sawa, mutu iye andakala moyo kpwa kuhenda vivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha mkuamba, ‘Njira za Mwenyezi Mlungu si za haki.’ Mwi atu a Iziraeli, nindakuamulani chila mmwenga kulengana na njiraze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
