                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.4+JER.52.5+JER.52.6+JER.52.7+JER.52.8+JER.52.9+JER.52.10+JER.52.11+JER.52.12+JER.52.13+JER.52.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "52:4–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya tsano ya mwezi wa kumi ya mwaka wa kumi na mbiri bada ya kutsamizwa kpwa lazima, nalokerwa ni mutu mmwenga ariyekala akachimbira Jerusalemu na achiamba, “Jerusalemu ikatekpwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi uwezo wa Mwenyezi Mlungu kala u dzulu yangu dziloni riro kabila ya ye mchimbizi kadzangbwenifikira. Mlungu kala akanipha tsona uwezo wa kugomba, ye mchimbizi ariphokpwedza ligundzu. Kpwa hivyo kauli yangu ichikala ikavugulwa, nami siyakala bwibwi tsona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami achiniamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, atu asagalao magandzoni ko Iziraeli anaenderera kuamba, ‘Burahimu kala ni iye tu nayo yo tsi kala ni yakpwe, ela vino hu anji, kpwa kpweli yo tsi hukaihewa ikale yehu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo aambire, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Kpwa kukala munarya nyama na milatsoye na kuviunurira vizuka vyenu matso genu na kuolaga atu asio na makosa, munawezadze kuamba yo tsi ni yenu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munakuluphira upanga wenu, munahenda mambo ga kutsukiza na chila mmwenga wenu analala mkpwaza myawe, munawezadze kuamba yo tsi ni yenu?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aambire hivi, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Kpwa kpweli dza niishivyo, aho asagalao magandzoni andaolagbwa na upanga na ario weruni nindaalavya ariwe ni nyama a tsakani na ario ngomeni na mapangoni andaolagbwa ni makongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami ndaihenda yo tsi ikale wekee na tuphu, na mkpwotsewe umuhendesao akale na ngulu undafika mwisho na myango ya Iziraeli indakala wekee chiasi cha kukala taphana mutu ndiyeitsupira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiphokala nkaihenda yo tsi gandzo huphu kpwa sababu ya kuhenda mambo ga kutsukiza, andamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, atuo achikala phamwenga nkugomba kukuhusu achikala kanda-kanda ya kuta na miryangoni, nkuambirana, ‘Ndzo usikize ujumbe kula kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi andakulokera kama kawaida edze asagale mberezo dza atu angu na kuphundza ugombago ela taandagalunga. Mana mendzwa yao ni ya mromo bahi, ela mioyo yao inahamirwa ni kuphaha mapato gasigo ga haki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lola, uwe u dza mutu aimbaye mawira ga arusi kpwa sauti nono kuno anapiga vinono chifwaya cha kuimbira, mana aho anasikira ugombago, ela taandagahenda bii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nago gaga ndiphotimiya, nago kpwa kpweli gandatimiya, nao andamanya kukala akala na nabii kahi yao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
